WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.048
RetoMaton makes two changes to the datastore.

00:00:04.128 --> 00:00:08.175
First,

00:00:08.255 --> 00:00:12.302
it saves a pointer from every entry to the entry
that came right after it in the text.

00:00:12.382 --> 00:00:16.430
Second, it clusters entries with similar key
vectors into states,

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:20.557
and those states share their outgoing pointers.

00:00:20.637 --> 00:00:24.685
Together these turn the flat datastore into a
weighted finite automaton.

00:00:24.765 --> 00:00:28.813
Building it is completely unsupervised, requires no
extra training data,

00:00:28.892 --> 00:00:32.940
and works whether the automaton is constructed from
the model's own training corpus or from a brand-new domain.
